    {"type":"text","id":"watcher_text","x":150,"y":190,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"👁  WATCHER\n(always on)\n\nwakes up when something\nhappens — a new email,\na calendar update, a ping\n\nreads the one thing,\nupdates the notebook,\ngoes back to sleep","originalText":"👁  WATCHER\n(always on)\n\nwakes up when something\nhappens — a new email,\na calendar update, a ping\n\nreads the one thing,\nupdates the notebook,\ngoes back to sleep","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#4c1d95","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":320002,"version":1,"versionNonce":320002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"watcher","lineHeight":1.3},

