    {"type":"text","id":"callout_text","x":150,"y":752,"width":1500,"height":96,"text":"The trick: the Watcher does real-time bookkeeping (cheap, reacts to every event), the Briefer does once-a-day judgment\n(more expensive, but only once). They share one shared notebook — files on disk, no database — and a simple lock\nstops them from writing at the same time. Three small focused agents beat one giant agent that has to do everything.","originalText":"The trick: the Watcher does real-time bookkeeping (cheap, reacts to every event), the Briefer does once-a-day judgment\n(more expensive, but only once). They share one shared notebook — files on disk, no database — and a simple lock\nstops them from writing at the same time. Three small focused agents beat one giant agent that has to do everything.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#7c2d12","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":360002,"version":1,"versionNonce":360002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"callout","lineHeight":1.4}
